{"about_the_game":"This game invites you to an action-packed adventure.<br>With interesting episode designs, a different adventure will be waiting for you in each episode.<br>Now, are you ready to hit all enemies?<br><br>In the game you are in charge of a secret military base, and you are a scientist working in a laboratory.<br>Many scientific researches are carried out in this facility.<br>Communicating with aliens is one of them.<br>Efforts to communicate with aliens are successful, and aliens come to earth and take over this military base and kill everyone.<br>You are the only survivors and you take this as a mission to yourself to send these aliens where they belong.<br>Different enemies, different weapons and different locations will be waiting for you in each level.<br><br><i>Note: You need to get the key to unlock the locked doors, after you get the key, go to the locked door and press enter.<br>If the door does not open, use the key on a different door.</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1404630?t=1697089474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1404630?t=1697089474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1697089474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1697089474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"This game invites you to an action-packed adventure.<br>With interesting episode designs, a different adventure will be waiting for you in each episode.<br>Now, are you ready to hit all enemies?<br><br>In the game you are in charge of a secret military base, and you are a scientist working in a laboratory.<br>Many scientific researches are carried out in this facility.<br>Communicating w